{"line":"registration","id":"V72R-S6-ARCHIVE","registeredAt":"2026-10-22T12:50:00Z","engineVersion":"3f556fa5a9de","hypothesis":"A year of Binance's public five-minute klines, each month's pairs chosen from the archive itself, can be gathered whole, every file checked against the SHA-256 Binance publishes beside it.","metric":"research/fetch-forecast-archive.mjs on October 2025 to September 2026: the USDT pairs of the archive's own listing (stable and fiat coins and leveraged tokens left out), ranked at each month by the month before's quote volume from their daily klines, the 40 largest with Bitcoin and ether that month's universe, listed with the pairs that entered and left; then every universe pair's five-minute klines for its months and the month before each. Each file counted checked (the published checksum matched), unchecked (none published), missing (not in the archive) or failed.","successLine":"No file fails its checksum, and at least 99% of the five-minute month files the universe asks for that the archive holds are on file and checked.","judgedOn":"the scratch folder traderspider-shadow/archive-profile, October 2025 to September 2026","kind":"confirmatory"}
{"line":"registration","id":"V72R-S6-GAINERS","registeredAt":"2026-10-22T12:50:00Z","engineVersion":"3f556fa5a9de","hypothesis":"A coin among the five of a month's universe that rose most over the last day, by 3% or more, keeps rising: the user's \"a 24-hour top gainer keeps rising\" (GAINERS, hypotheses-v1).","metric":"At every hour's close of the year, the GAINERS calls: up, for each of the five pairs that rose most over the day before, each at least 3%. Each call is judged at an hour, four hours and a day apart (research/hypotheses.ts, shared/forecast/hypotheses.ts hypothesisFiguresOf): the calls; the share whose move went the way called, with its 95% interval resampled by calendar hour in blocks as long as the horizon; the skill, the share right less the share of the month's coin-hours that went the way called at that horizon (the drift a call must beat); the skill in the year's two halves (October to March, April to September) and in the pairs' two (pairHalfOf); the mean move in the way called less the 0.24% round trip, with its interval; and the calls by month with their mean move.","successLine":"A horizon gets a direction from the rule only where it has at least 200 calls, the share right with its lower bound above 50%, a skill of at least a point, and the skill above zero in each of the four halves (promoted), and is TRADEABLE where the mean move less the round trip is above zero with its lower bound; each horizon is judged apart (three horizons, no correction for them). Otherwise NEUTRAL stays at that horizon, with the figures.","judgedOn":"the year archive (traderspider-shadow/archive-profile, research/fetch-forecast-archive.mjs), October 2025 to September 2026, each month the 40 USDT pairs largest by the month before's quote volume with Bitcoin and ether","kind":"confirmatory","constants":["forecast.hypotheses"]}
{"line":"registration","id":"V72R-S6-LEADERS","registeredAt":"2026-10-22T12:50:00Z","engineVersion":"3f556fa5a9de","hypothesis":"Where Bitcoin and ether both moved 1% or more the same way over the last four hours, every other coin goes that way: the user's \"Bitcoin's and ether's trend sets the alts' way\" (LEADERS).","metric":"At every hour's close of the year, the LEADERS calls: every other pair of the month's universe, that way. Each call is judged at an hour, four hours and a day apart (research/hypotheses.ts, shared/forecast/hypotheses.ts hypothesisFiguresOf): the calls; the share whose move went the way called, with its 95% interval resampled by calendar hour in blocks as long as the horizon; the skill, the share right less the share of the month's coin-hours that went the way called at that horizon (the drift a call must beat); the skill in the year's two halves (October to March, April to September) and in the pairs' two (pairHalfOf); the mean move in the way called less the 0.24% round trip, with its interval; and the calls by month with their mean move.","successLine":"A horizon gets a direction from the rule only where it has at least 200 calls, the share right with its lower bound above 50%, a skill of at least a point, and the skill above zero in each of the four halves (promoted), and is TRADEABLE where the mean move less the round trip is above zero with its lower bound; each horizon is judged apart (three horizons, no correction for them). Otherwise NEUTRAL stays at that horizon, with the figures.","judgedOn":"the year archive (traderspider-shadow/archive-profile, research/fetch-forecast-archive.mjs), October 2025 to September 2026, each month the 40 USDT pairs largest by the month before's quote volume with Bitcoin and ether","kind":"confirmatory","constants":["forecast.hypotheses"]}
{"line":"registration","id":"V72R-S6-CATALYST","registeredAt":"2026-10-22T12:50:00Z","engineVersion":"3f556fa5a9de","hypothesis":"A coin Binance's own announcement names goes the way its kind went before -- down after a spot delisting or a Monitoring Tag, up after a spot listing or a USDT perpetual's launch -- from the first hour's close a minute after the release: the user's \"a verified news catalyst's way\" (CATALYST).","metric":"Binance's announcements of the year (research/fetch-announcements.mjs), each title read with the app's own patterns (shared/newsTitles.ts), each named coin's spot one-minute candles around it (research/fetch-news-candles.mjs; delisted coins included), one call a coin and announcement at the first hour's close a minute after the release; the base rate the month's universe's. Each call is judged at an hour, four hours and a day apart (research/hypotheses.ts, shared/forecast/hypotheses.ts hypothesisFiguresOf): the calls; the share whose move went the way called, with its 95% interval resampled by calendar hour in blocks as long as the horizon; the skill, the share right less the share of the month's coin-hours that went the way called at that horizon (the drift a call must beat); the skill in the year's two halves (October to March, April to September) and in the pairs' two (pairHalfOf); the mean move in the way called less the 0.24% round trip, with its interval; and the calls by month with their mean move.","successLine":"A horizon gets a direction from the rule only where it has at least 200 calls, the share right with its lower bound above 50%, a skill of at least a point, and the skill above zero in each of the four halves (promoted), and is TRADEABLE where the mean move less the round trip is above zero with its lower bound; each horizon is judged apart (three horizons, no correction for them). Otherwise NEUTRAL stays at that horizon, with the figures.","judgedOn":"Binance's announcements of October 2025 to September 2026 (.candles/news) and the one-minute spot candles around them, against the year archive's base rates","kind":"confirmatory","constants":["forecast.hypotheses"]}
