{"line":"registration","id":"V72R-S8-SHADOW","registeredAt":"2026-10-22T19:31:00Z","engineVersion":"1142c98ef19f","hypothesis":"A challenger in its shadow week (challenger-v3, shadow-v1) forecasts the closes the run in use forecasts, from the same bars, books and news, into its own record, and changes nothing the run in use records, shows or trades on; its week's verdict is read from the two records paired on the same pairs and closes.","metric":"Over Stage 9's runs, at the closes while a shadow is held: the share of the run in use's grid forecasts (pair and close) the shadow also forecast; the share of the shadow's horizons due before the run's end settled or marked missing; the lines of the run in use's predictions, outcomes, passes and paper trades that name the shadow's run; and, where a shadow's week ends within a run, the verdict read again from the two records by forecastShadowVerdict against the one the training log holds.","successLine":"At least 99% of the run in use's grid forecasts paired by the shadow's; at least 99% of the shadow's due horizons settled or marked missing; no line of the run in use's record or paper trades names the shadow's run; a verdict read again equal to the one logged. Not measured where no shadow is held in any run.","judgedOn":"Stage 9's runs on scratch profiles: forecasts/ with its shadow-* files and the training log; a run may begin with a shadow its harness seeds from a run on the profile's file (current.json's shadow), since a refit that clears the walk forward may not come within a run","kind":"confirmatory","constants":["forecast.challenger.shadow"]}
